    <panel_attributes>title=SD3 - Auto-schedule with a strategy, the weather and preferences (F04, F08, F09 / UC04, UC08)
obj=Student~s ACTOR
obj=:MainWindow~w
obj=:MainController~c
obj=:PlannerFacade~f
obj=weather:OpenMeteoWeather~we
obj=:Scheduler~sch
obj=strategy:DeadlineFirstStrategy~st
obj=:Workspace~ws
obj=:ConflictChecker~cc
s-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : choose Deadline first and click Auto-schedule
w-&gt;&gt;&gt;c : onAutoSchedule("deadline")
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;f : autoSchedule("deadline")
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;f + : strategyFor("deadline")
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;sch : setStrategy(strategy)
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;we : forecast(today, today plus 7 days)
combinedFragment=alt~a1 f we
f:[forecast received]
we.&gt;f : Forecast
..=a1
f:[Open-Meteo not reachable]
we.&gt;f : IOException
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;f + : continue without rain data and warn the student
--=a1
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;sch : schedule(workspace, from, to, forecast)
sch-&gt;&gt;&gt;ws : tasksToSchedule()
ws.&gt;sch : tasks
sch-&gt;&gt;&gt;st : sort(tasks)
st.&gt;sch : tasks in deadline order
sch-&gt;&gt;&gt;ws : busyBetween(from, to)
ws.&gt;sch : busy times from events and planned blocks
combinedFragment=loop~l1 sch ws
sch:[each task, then each 30-minute start time until one fits]
sch-&gt;&gt;&gt;sch + : fits(task, start, workspace, forecast)
--=l1
sch.&gt;f : ScheduleResult, placed blocks and reasons for tasks that did not fit
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;f + : wrap each block in an AddBlockCommand
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;ws : copy()
ws.&gt;f : trial workspace with the commands applied
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;cc : check(trial, forecast)
cc.&gt;f : conflicts
f.&gt;c : Proposal
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : showProposal(proposal)
ref=s c : SD5 - apply or discard the proposal</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
